      "sentenceId": "c02-s03-p020-06720-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Similarly, when people were asked to talk to a stranger (i.e., acting like an extravert), people felt far happier than they had anticipated.",
      "sentenceSha256": "61bd151f03c7df8f5e3adf7d94a5cf0c6bfd3dff1ad7c12ef771e8a76ee198a0",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s03-p020-06720-r001-004",
